{%- comment -%}
  A section's feature image, with its LQIP.

  about, craft and visit each wrote this `<img>` out by hand and they differed
  only where they should — craft's column is wider, so it asks for a 1200px
  source, a fourth srcset width and `45vw`, where the other two ask for 1000px
  and `40vw`. The shape was identical, including the parts that are a
  theme-wide contract rather than a section's choice.

  **The LQIP is the reason this is a snippet and not a convention.** Every
  theme-controlled `<img>` must carry `data-image-lqip` at roughly 40px of the
  *same* source — it is what `theme.js` puts in the facade above the real
  image. Written by hand at each call site it is one line to forget, and
  forgetting it is invisible until someone loads the page on a slow connection.
  Here it cannot be forgotten. `veylin-lint`'s R10 still checks the whole
  theme, for the call sites this does not cover yet.

  `width` and `height` come from the image itself so the box is reserved before
  it loads, which theme check requires (`ImgWidthAndHeight`) and which is what
  keeps the section from shifting as it arrives.

  Accepts:
    image       - the image drop. Falls back to a placeholder when blank.
    sizes       - the `sizes` attribute. Required; the caller knows its column.
    widths      - comma-separated srcset widths. Defaults to 400,700,1000.
    src_width   - the `src` fallback width. Defaults to the largest srcset width.
    placeholder - a `placeholder_svg_tag` name for the empty state.
    loading     - `lazy` (default) or `eager`.
    class       - extra classes for the caller.

  Deliberately no `crop`: these are art-directed feature images and the whole
  frame is the point. The card and hero crop and are not callers.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign w_list = widths | default: '400,700,1000' | split: ','
  assign biggest = w_list | last
  assign src_w = src_width | default: biggest
  assign load = loading | default: 'lazy'
-%}

{%- if image != blank -%}
  <img
    {% if class != blank %}class="{{ class }}"{% endif %}
    src="{{ image | image_url: width: src_w }}"
    data-image-lqip="{{ image | image_url: width: 40 }}"
    srcset="
      {%- for w in w_list -%}
        {{ image | image_url: width: w }} {{ w }}w{% unless forloop.last %}, {% endunless %}
      {%- endfor -%}
    "
    sizes="{{ sizes }}"
    alt="{{ image.alt | escape }}"
    width="{{ image.width }}"
    height="{{ image.height }}"
    loading="{{ load }}"
  >
{%- else -%}
  {{ placeholder | default: 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg' }}
{%- endif -%}
